---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Jadwal & Rundown Hari-H — BAZNAS Fun Walk 2026" activePage="jadwal">
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="sec sec--dark page-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Jadwal & Agenda</p>
      <h1>Timeline & Rundown Lengkap Acara</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Panduan waktu mulai dari pengambilan race pack hingga pelaksanaan jalan sehat dan pengundian doorprize di hari Minggu, 22 November 2026.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RPC Section -->
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Pengambilan Paket Lari</p>
        <h2>Race Pack Collection (RPC)</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Peserta wajib mengambil paket race pack (jersey, tote bag, nomor BIB & wristband) sebelum hari pelaksanaan.
        </p>
        
        <div class="rpc-schedule-cards">
          <div class="rpc-card">
            <div class="rpc-day">Kamis, 19 November 2026</div>
            <div class="rpc-time">Pukul 09.00 – 17.00 WIB</div>
            <div class="rpc-note">Hari pertama pengambilan paket peserta</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rpc-card">
            <div class="rpc-day">Jumat, 20 November 2026</div>
            <div class="rpc-time">Pukul 09.00 – 17.00 WIB</div>
            <div class="rpc-note">(Istirahat Shalat Jumat 11.30 – 13.00 WIB)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rpc-card rpc-card--highlight">
            <div class="rpc-day">Sabtu, 21 November 2026</div>
            <div class="rpc-time">Pukul 08.00 – 18.00 WIB</div>
            <div class="rpc-note">Hari terakhir pengambilan sebelum Hari-H</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-clean rpc-terms">
        <h4>Syarat & Tata Cara Pengambilan:</h4>
        <ul class="rpc-steps">
          <li>
            <span class="step-num">1</span>
            <div>
              <b>Tunjukkan E-Ticket Digital:</b>
              <p>Cukup perlihatkan Kode QR pada e-ticket di layar smartphone Anda (dapat diakses di menu <a href="/cek-tiket">Cek Tiket</a>).</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="step-num">2</span>
            <div>
              <b>Bisa Diwakilkan?</b>
              <p>Bisa, cukup tunjukkan foto atau screenshot E-Ticket peserta.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="rpc-location-box">
          <b>Lokasi Pengambilan:</b>
          <p>Lobby Gedung Budaya Sabilulungan, Jl. Terusan Al Fathu, Soreang, Kab. Bandung.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Rundown Hari-H -->
  <section class="sec sec--tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div style="text-align:center; max-width:700px; margin:0 auto 48px">
        <p class="kicker">Rundown Hari Pelaksanaan</p>
        <h2>Minggu, 22 November 2026</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto">
          Pastikan Anda tiba tepat waktu di lokasi Gedung Budaya Sabilulungan untuk mengikuti seluruh rangkaian acara.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rundown-table-card card-clean">
        <table class="rundown-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="width:160px">Waktu (WIB)</th>
              <th>Agenda Kegiatan</th>
              <th>Keterangan / Lokasi</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><b class="time-tag">05.00 – 05.30</b></td>
              <td><b>Kedatangan Peserta & Shalat Subuh</b></td>
              <td>Tersedia mushola di Gedung Sabilulungan & Masjid Agung Soreang</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><b class="time-tag">05.30 – 05.45</b></td>
              <td><b>Senam Pemanasan Ringan Bersama</b></td>
              <td>Dipandu oleh instruktur senam profesional di panggung utama</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><b class="time-tag">05.45 – 06.00</b></td>
              <td><b>Seremoni Pembukaan & Doa Bersama</b></td>
              <td>Sambutan Ketua BAZNAS Kab. Bandung & Doa Keselamatan</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="row-highlight">
              <td><b class="time-tag time-tag--flag">06.00 WIB</b></td>
              <td><b>FLAG-OFF START BAZNAS FUN WALK 5K </b></td>
              <td>Pelepasan peserta di Gerbang Start Jl. Al Fathu</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><b class="time-tag">06.00 – 07.45</b></td>
              <td><b>Pelaksanaan Jalan Sehat 5K</b></td>
              <td>Menikmati rute Soreang, mampir di Water Station & Pos Foto</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><b class="time-tag">07.45 – 08.15</b></td>
              <td><b>Finish, Pembagian Refreshment & Sarapan</b></td>
              <td>Penukaran gelang peserta dengan paket snack & sarapan UMKM BAZNAS</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><b class="time-tag">08.15 – 09.00</b></td>
              <td><b>Panggung Hiburan Musik Islami & Tausiyah</b></td>
              <td>Tausiyah inspiratif seputar keutamaan sedekah & kesehatan</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="row-highlight">
              <td><b class="time-tag time-tag--doorprize">09.00 – 10.15</b></td>
              <td><b>PENGUNDIAN DOORPRIZE UTAMA </b></td>
              <td>Paket Umroh, Sepeda Motor, Sepeda Listrik, Kulkas, TV & Doorprize Menarik</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><b class="time-tag">10.15 – 10.30</b></td>
              <td><b>Penutupan & Sesi Foto Bersama</b></td>
              <td>Acara selesai, peserta kembali dengan tertib</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:36px">
        <a href="/daftar" class="btn btn-sun btn-lg">Daftar Sekarang Agar Tidak Ketinggalan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: clamp(50px, 6vw, 80px) 0;
  }

  .rpc-schedule-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .rpc-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .rpc-card--highlight {
    border-color: var(--leaf);
    background: #FAFCF9;
  }

  .rpc-day {
    font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .rpc-time {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--leaf);
    margin: 2px 0 4px;
  }

  .rpc-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--grey);
  }

  .rpc-terms {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .rpc-terms h4 {
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .rpc-steps {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .rpc-steps li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .step-num {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .rpc-steps b {
    color: var(--ink);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .rpc-steps p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--grey);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .rpc-steps a {
    color: var(--leaf);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .rpc-location-box {
    background: var(--paper-2);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--leaf);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 0 var(--r-sm) var(--r-sm) 0;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .rpc-location-box b {
    color: var(--ink);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .rpc-location-box p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--grey-d);
  }

  /* Rundown Table */
  .rundown-table-card {
    padding: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .rundown-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .rundown-table th, .rundown-table td {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .rundown-table thead th {
    background: var(--paper-2);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .time-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--paper-2);
    color: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .time-tag--flag {
    background: var(--leaf);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: var(--leaf);
  }

  .time-tag--doorprize {
    background: var(--sun);
    color: var(--ink-deep);
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }

  .row-highlight {
    background: rgba(31, 137, 57, 0.05);
  }
</style>
